WEBVTT

00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:16.090
Nobody hit the switch or anything, right?

00:00:17.960 --> 00:00:19.300
Chie...

00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:23.680
Hey, this looks like
that other screen, doesn't it?

00:00:25.050 --> 00:00:26.350
You mean the Midnight Channel?

00:00:26.350 --> 00:00:27.010
Huh?

00:00:27.010 --> 00:00:28.350
Now that you mention it...

00:00:28.350 --> 00:00:30.350
True... It does look similar...

00:00:32.940 --> 00:00:33.810
Oh!

00:00:33.810 --> 00:00:34.560
What the hell is this?

00:00:34.560 --> 00:00:35.690
Whoaaaa!

00:00:41.110 --> 00:00:43.200
There is no need to be afraid.

00:00:44.660 --> 00:00:49.950
The truth that you seek. I've connected
you to the path that will lead you there.

00:00:54.710 --> 00:00:55.710
Senpai?

00:00:59.170 --> 00:00:59.920
Narukami-kun?

00:00:59.920 --> 00:01:00.550
Look out!

00:01:01.420 --> 00:01:03.380
Now, give me your hand.

00:01:03.840 --> 00:01:04.590
Hey! Yu!

00:01:21.610 --> 00:01:23.650
Am I...

00:01:23.650 --> 00:01:25.610
...inside the TV?

00:03:28.610 --> 00:03:32.570
This is the first time we've seen each other
outside that room.

00:03:32.620 --> 00:03:33.870
Yes.

00:03:34.410 --> 00:03:39.460
Normally, my job
is to observe our clients' fate.

00:03:40.170 --> 00:03:43.540
I'm supposed to avoid directly interfering.

00:03:43.920 --> 00:03:49.920
But you yourself reeled it in.
The bond that by rights should have vanished.

00:03:53.050 --> 00:03:57.560
Therefore, you should once again
confront that bond and,

00:03:57.560 --> 00:04:02.650
now knowing the truth, create an opportunity
to consider what path you'll choose.

00:04:02.650 --> 00:04:05.900
That is what I have determined.

00:04:06.320 --> 00:04:07.650
You mean Marie, right?

00:04:12.700 --> 00:04:14.120
What's the matter?

00:04:14.120 --> 00:04:18.290
It seems that your friends
have arrived as well.

00:04:18.290 --> 00:04:20.460
-Ouch, ouch...
-Yoooo!

00:04:21.960 --> 00:04:24.830
Are we inside that TV? This place...

00:04:25.540 --> 00:04:28.210
I mean, why am I wearing my uniform?

00:04:30.090 --> 00:04:32.720
Hey, this is so messed up!

00:04:35.180 --> 00:04:39.810
So we followed Narukami-kun
inside the TV, huh?

00:04:40.890 --> 00:04:44.730
This looks like Okina City,
but there's something weird about it.

00:04:46.900 --> 00:04:47.730
Yo...

00:04:48.230 --> 00:04:50.570
What the hell is going on here?

00:04:51.400 --> 00:04:53.950
We're inside that TV, right?

00:04:53.950 --> 00:04:58.200
But somehow, it seems different
than the one we know.

00:04:59.160 --> 00:05:01.080
I agree. What on earth...

00:05:01.120 --> 00:05:03.040
You guys, are you all right?

00:05:03.040 --> 00:05:04.620
Yu-senpai?

00:05:04.620 --> 00:05:07.380
Sensei! Where are you?

00:05:07.380 --> 00:05:09.500
How about you? Are you okay?

00:05:09.500 --> 00:05:11.460
No need to worry about me.

00:05:11.510 --> 00:05:15.300
Right now, I'm getting help
from an acquaintance to talk to you guys.

00:05:15.300 --> 00:05:16.890
An acquaintance?

00:05:17.390 --> 00:05:20.680
I'll fill you in later. First, let's meet up.

00:05:21.140 --> 00:05:23.390
Rise, can I count on you
to guide everyone here?

00:05:23.390 --> 00:05:25.940
Oh, sure. Leave it to me!

00:05:32.150 --> 00:05:33.030
Over there.

00:05:32.150 --> 00:05:33.070
Found them!

00:05:33.660 --> 00:05:35.280
Chie-senpai and Yukiko-senpai!

00:05:35.280 --> 00:05:37.570
I'm going to navigate,
so please follow my guidance.

00:05:37.570 --> 00:05:38.780
Gotcha.

00:05:38.780 --> 00:05:40.830
We're counting on you, Rise.

00:05:42.500 --> 00:05:44.620
Please forgive me.

00:05:44.830 --> 00:05:48.670
Because I linked this place
and the TV somewhat by force,

00:05:48.670 --> 00:05:51.300
the entrance has become unstable.

00:05:51.800 --> 00:05:55.630
As a result, even though you entered
from the same location,

00:05:55.630 --> 00:05:58.300
you must have gotten separated.

00:06:05.940 --> 00:06:07.900
What is this place, exactly?

00:06:11.520 --> 00:06:14.110
This is the Hollow Forest.

00:06:14.110 --> 00:06:20.410
A closed-off area that she detached
from a side of this vast world.

00:06:20.410 --> 00:06:23.040
The Hollow... Forest...

00:06:29.170 --> 00:06:30.670
Yoo-hoo!

00:06:31.000 --> 00:06:32.880
Wh-What's this?

00:06:32.880 --> 00:06:34.760
It's from that quiz show...

00:06:35.510 --> 00:06:38.760
Ever since she left you, as well as us,

00:06:38.760 --> 00:06:42.470
Marie has shut herself away here.

00:06:43.220 --> 00:06:44.640
Chie...

00:06:44.640 --> 00:06:47.730
Most likely, the reason is her memories.

00:06:47.730 --> 00:06:52.270
As you know, Marie had been searching
for her own memories.

00:06:52.270 --> 00:06:54.730
And due to some catalyst or other,

00:06:54.730 --> 00:06:57.030
that girl was able to recover them.

00:07:00.530 --> 00:07:02.200
A stage?

00:07:02.200 --> 00:07:05.330
Is this... Marie-chan's guitar?

00:07:05.330 --> 00:07:09.540
I know it's the TV world,
but everything in here's too damn real!

00:07:09.540 --> 00:07:14.840
What kind of memories she recovered,
even I have no clue.

00:07:14.840 --> 00:07:20.180
But the fact that she's chosen to lock herself
up because she regained her memories...

00:07:20.180 --> 00:07:22.850
That must be more telling than anything else.

00:07:23.510 --> 00:07:25.310
That was selfish of her!

00:07:26.470 --> 00:07:30.850
Marie is about to go to sleep here
in the deepest part of this area.

00:07:30.850 --> 00:07:32.810
If you wish to see her,

00:07:33.570 --> 00:07:37.860
you must all prepare yourselves
for danger as you continue on.

00:07:38.240 --> 00:07:41.280
Danger? You mean the Shadows?

00:07:41.320 --> 00:07:43.530
They're not the only danger.

00:07:43.530 --> 00:07:47.540
This Hollow Forest
will soon be closed off forever.

00:07:47.910 --> 00:07:53.460
When that happens, should you still be here,
you'll lose your means of getting out.

00:07:54.590 --> 00:07:59.260
Normally, this Hollow Forest
is closed off from the world.

00:07:59.260 --> 00:08:03.350
Since it is not yet complete at this time,
by using the TV as a medium,

00:08:03.350 --> 00:08:07.850
I was able to connect it to the outside world,
but when the time comes...

00:08:07.850 --> 00:08:09.180
Hold up!

00:08:09.180 --> 00:08:11.690
If it closes down for good,
then what will become of Marie?

00:08:11.690 --> 00:08:12.980
She's here, right?

00:08:13.860 --> 00:08:16.610
Should this place close down completely,

00:08:16.610 --> 00:08:20.360
it will mean that that girl's soul,
and the bonds she's built will also be cut off.

00:08:20.360 --> 00:08:24.740
When that happens,
the fact that Marie ever existed

00:08:24.740 --> 00:08:27.620
will vanish from your memories,
this time for good.

00:08:32.250 --> 00:08:33.750
Hey!

00:08:34.130 --> 00:08:36.540
Finally, we found each other!

00:08:37.210 --> 00:08:39.010
Hey, there they are.

00:08:39.010 --> 00:08:41.840
Thank goodness! Everyone's safe.

00:08:42.430 --> 00:08:45.100
Now we just gotta find Narukami-senpai, huh?

00:08:45.100 --> 00:08:49.390
I can sense him getting closer.
He should be here any second now.

00:08:53.600 --> 00:08:55.610
Whoa! What's that?

00:09:00.440 --> 00:09:01.440
But that's...

00:09:09.540 --> 00:09:10.750
Marie-chan!

00:09:10.750 --> 00:09:12.580
Have you been here all this time?

00:09:12.580 --> 00:09:14.830
Marie-chan, it's dangerous here!

00:09:14.830 --> 00:09:16.880
He's right, there might be
some Shadows around.

00:09:16.880 --> 00:09:18.550
Let's get out of here...

00:09:18.550 --> 00:09:19.750
I don't care what happens.

00:09:19.840 --> 00:09:21.210
Marie-chan...

00:09:21.210 --> 00:09:22.670
Huh?

00:09:22.670 --> 00:09:25.220
What the hell are you saying?
Come on, let's go home.

00:09:25.890 --> 00:09:28.050
There's nowhere for me to go.

00:09:28.050 --> 00:09:30.520
You just don't have a clue, do you?

00:09:36.440 --> 00:09:38.440
Hey, what's with your face?

00:09:39.110 --> 00:09:43.150
I don't believe you.
Why did you come? Why?

00:09:44.530 --> 00:09:47.120
See, I remember everything now.

00:09:47.450 --> 00:09:50.120
You remember? Not your memories?

00:09:50.740 --> 00:09:59.340
Who I was, why I was in that city.
I thought I wanted to know.

00:10:00.050 --> 00:10:04.840
But... When I did remember,
nothing good came of it.

00:10:05.130 --> 00:10:06.510
Marie-chan...

00:10:07.550 --> 00:10:09.300
Listen to me, Marie-chan.

00:10:09.300 --> 00:10:14.600
I don't know what kind of memories you
regained, or how painful they are.

00:10:14.600 --> 00:10:17.980
But staying here won't do you any good!

00:10:19.190 --> 00:10:22.570
We know we're being busybodies.
But we want to help.

00:10:24.690 --> 00:10:27.490
You said it. Total busybodies!

00:10:29.780 --> 00:10:36.000
Apparently, that girl intends to close off
this forest as soon as possible.

00:10:36.250 --> 00:10:38.000
Why would she do that?

00:10:38.000 --> 00:10:42.050
This is just my personal speculation,

00:10:42.050 --> 00:10:45.510
but I believe it's all
out of consideration for you.

00:10:46.680 --> 00:10:49.840
I'm picking up a lot of strong signals
from the Shadows here.

00:10:49.840 --> 00:10:52.260
It's too dangerous to shut yourself up
in a place like this!

00:10:52.260 --> 00:10:53.890
You've got to get out!

00:10:53.890 --> 00:10:57.020
Dangerous? I already know that.

00:10:57.020 --> 00:10:58.400
But it doesn't matter.

00:10:58.400 --> 00:11:02.020
But you could very well die!
Aren't you aware of...

00:11:03.190 --> 00:11:05.990
I told you. That's fine with me.

00:11:06.860 --> 00:11:09.780
She doesn't want you to stress over her.

00:11:10.160 --> 00:11:16.250
This is a grave, you know. My grave.
I'm going to die here.

00:11:17.120 --> 00:11:21.400
She doesn't want to ruin the daily lives
you've finally gotten back

00:11:21.400 --> 00:11:23.670
because she cares about you.

00:11:23.710 --> 00:11:26.260
That's what could be going
through that girl's mind.

00:11:31.090 --> 00:11:35.310
Don't give me that! There are things
that you should and shouldn't joke about!

00:11:36.770 --> 00:11:39.060
Shut up! You don't know anything!

00:11:39.560 --> 00:11:41.730
If you want to consider her feelings,

00:11:41.730 --> 00:11:46.650
then don't put yourselves in danger,
and feel free to treasure your daily lives.

00:11:46.650 --> 00:11:49.530
That is precisely what Marie wishes.

00:11:50.280 --> 00:11:54.530
Sorry, but I have no intention
of granting her a wish like that.

00:11:58.620 --> 00:12:00.580
Is that right?

00:12:04.750 --> 00:12:10.800
If that's the path you've chosen,
then I have no reason to stop you.

00:12:30.950 --> 00:12:34.620
The rest is up to you.
I wish you every success.

00:12:36.030 --> 00:12:37.950
Wait for us, Marie!

00:12:47.250 --> 00:12:49.880
Go home! Please... for heaven's sake!

00:12:50.220 --> 00:12:54.050
I totally know how you feel, Marie-chan.

00:12:54.050 --> 00:12:58.430
When I found out that I was a Shadow,
it was such a huge shock...

00:12:59.180 --> 00:13:03.190
You're probably feeling the same way
that I did that day.

00:13:03.190 --> 00:13:06.480
You're thinking that you
shouldn't be here, right?

00:13:06.820 --> 00:13:09.570
No, I'm not. It's not like that at all!

00:13:10.110 --> 00:13:11.320
Marie-chan...

00:13:11.740 --> 00:13:14.030
Marie's not even my name!

00:13:20.000 --> 00:13:22.620
What kind of power is this? A Persona?

00:13:22.620 --> 00:13:24.750
N-No, not that.

00:13:24.750 --> 00:13:29.090
That wasn't a Persona or a Shadow!
It was something more special...

00:13:29.090 --> 00:13:30.210
Huh?

00:13:31.880 --> 00:13:32.550
Yu...

00:13:36.260 --> 00:13:41.770
So you came, too. Good timing.
I'm going to let you in on something.

00:13:41.770 --> 00:13:43.810
The memories that I got back.

00:13:45.900 --> 00:13:50.280
My... my real name is Kusumi-no-Okami.

00:13:50.860 --> 00:13:52.360
But that name is...

00:13:53.240 --> 00:13:58.780
You all fought them, didn't you?
Ameno-Sagiri and Kunino-Sagiri.

00:13:58.780 --> 00:14:01.160
I'm the same as them.

00:14:01.160 --> 00:14:04.160
I covered the city in fog... I'm your enemy.

00:14:05.370 --> 00:14:08.170
What are you talking about?
What do you mean?

00:14:08.750 --> 00:14:13.340
To blend into the human world,
to feel the human world,

00:14:13.340 --> 00:14:18.970
to let the Sagiris know
what the humans wish for - that's my job.

00:14:18.970 --> 00:14:22.060
That's why I was the only one in human form.

00:14:22.060 --> 00:14:25.980
Even if I had no memories,
my body was able to function.

00:14:25.980 --> 00:14:29.440
In your language, I'm what you'd call a spy.

00:14:29.440 --> 00:14:30.690
Whaaat?

00:14:30.690 --> 00:14:33.110
You're a spy, Marie-chan?

00:14:33.110 --> 00:14:34.190
No way...

00:14:35.360 --> 00:14:37.820
So now you understand, don't you?

00:14:37.820 --> 00:14:41.490
Bringing me back to your world
would be pointless.

00:14:41.490 --> 00:14:43.200
If you can see that, then...

00:14:44.410 --> 00:14:46.620
What, are you mad?

00:14:46.960 --> 00:14:48.960
Yeah, I'm pretty livid.

00:14:49.460 --> 00:14:52.710
What are you, a moron? It's all your fault.

00:14:52.710 --> 00:14:56.130
An enemy right under your nose,
and you never even noticed!

00:14:56.130 --> 00:14:57.090
You're wrong.

00:14:57.090 --> 00:14:57.930
Huh?

00:14:58.050 --> 00:15:02.100
I don't give a damn about that.
Why did you leave without telling us?

00:15:03.430 --> 00:15:07.060
A-Are you an idiot?
Haven't you heard a word I've said?

00:15:07.060 --> 00:15:10.860
I was your enemy all along!
There's no way I can be with you!

00:15:14.570 --> 00:15:17.530
You're the one who made me promise
to give this back.

00:15:17.530 --> 00:15:19.610
That you'd never forgive me
if I disappeared with it.

00:15:19.610 --> 00:15:21.370
That's what you said to me!

00:15:21.370 --> 00:15:22.780
Even so...

00:15:22.780 --> 00:15:25.700
You also said that we'd
be making memories together.

00:15:25.700 --> 00:15:26.370
And yet...

00:15:26.370 --> 00:15:28.040
Shut up! Shut your mouth, moron!

00:15:28.040 --> 00:15:30.040
Don't just vanish on your own, moron!

00:15:30.040 --> 00:15:32.750
What's up with that, moron?
You're impossible to talk to.

00:15:32.750 --> 00:15:34.300
You're the moron!

00:15:34.340 --> 00:15:35.840
Full of all that stupid, pompous talk!

00:15:35.840 --> 00:15:38.380
It's not stupid! It's important, moron!

00:15:38.380 --> 00:15:40.510
Shut up, who gives a damn, moron?

00:15:40.510 --> 00:15:41.720
Don't call me a moron!

00:15:41.720 --> 00:15:43.760
You're saying it yourself, moron!

00:15:43.760 --> 00:15:45.180
-Hey.
-I'm going home, moron!

00:15:45.180 --> 00:15:46.850
Just go home, moron!

00:15:47.810 --> 00:15:51.900
Why can't you understand?
I'm doing this for you guys...

00:15:52.150 --> 00:15:53.400
You're doing this for us?

00:15:54.020 --> 00:15:58.650
Jeez! I'm done! If you come any closer,
don't look at me if you end up dying!

00:15:58.650 --> 00:16:01.910
If you don't want to die,
then get out of here!

00:16:02.240 --> 00:16:04.240
Hold up, Marie!

00:16:08.250 --> 00:16:10.500
Humph! A whole horde of pissants!

00:16:10.500 --> 00:16:13.170
Be careful!
Tons and tons more will be coming!

00:16:13.170 --> 00:16:15.170
No matter how many show up,
I'll take them on!

00:16:15.170 --> 00:16:17.130
Yeah! Let's do this!

00:16:22.720 --> 00:16:26.140
<i>Hey, listen to my voice,</i>

00:16:26.140 --> 00:16:28.680
<i>this voice with which I'm shouting...</i>

00:16:28.680 --> 00:16:30.810
<i>I am here.</i>

00:16:30.810 --> 00:16:34.150
<i>I've turned my blood into a voice,
and I'm shouting at the ends of the earth.</i>

00:16:35.440 --> 00:16:37.650
<i>I am a mermaid princess</i>

00:16:37.650 --> 00:16:40.150
<i>A mermaid princess who can never return.</i>

00:16:40.150 --> 00:16:43.070
<i>A little mermaid who will vanish
in a sea of bubbles...</i>

00:16:45.240 --> 00:16:50.210
<i>Where am I going, you ask?
Don't ask stupid questions...</i>

00:16:50.210 --> 00:16:52.080
<i>No need for a map,</i>

00:16:52.080 --> 00:16:54.540
<i>I tossed my compass long ago.</i>

00:16:54.540 --> 00:16:57.920
<i>My pathos will show me the way!</i>

00:16:57.920 --> 00:17:00.920
<i>I'm going to walk alone.</i>

00:17:02.130 --> 00:17:05.640
<i>Spicy mint tea for mornings we don't meet,</i>

00:17:06.430 --> 00:17:08.970
<i>And for brunch, a marmalade muffin.</i>

00:17:09.220 --> 00:17:11.770
<i>I'm in just the right mood for something bittersweet.</i>

00:17:12.270 --> 00:17:14.230
<i>These sighs are like stardust</i>

00:17:14.810 --> 00:17:18.360
<i>As if it were a milky way for you and me.</i>

00:17:18.980 --> 00:17:22.530
<i>You know, I can't catch up to your back.</i>

00:17:22.700 --> 00:17:26.240
<i>Look, twilight has already crept in.</i>

00:17:26.740 --> 00:17:31.290
<i>The distance to you is like
right before a neverending dawn,</i>

00:17:32.120 --> 00:17:35.670
<i>An endlessly continuing midnight blue.</i>

00:17:37.210 --> 00:17:40.260
<i>A fallen angel is bound by chains,</i>

00:17:40.260 --> 00:17:46.760
<i>Wings torn off, consumed by prejudice,
she tries to take a breath within the black hope</i>

00:17:47.680 --> 00:17:51.220
<i>Hey, do you know her name?</i>

00:17:47.760 --> 00:17:48.810
Kanji!

00:17:51.520 --> 00:17:54.560
<i>Before long her forgetfulness will
drive her away yonder.</i>

00:17:54.560 --> 00:17:58.110
<i>Will she return above?</i>

00:17:58.110 --> 00:18:04.740
<i>Soon the requiem will end in pain,
and the mask of lies will be ripped off.</i>

00:18:05.990 --> 00:18:07.570
<i>Close your eyes...</i>

00:18:07.570 --> 00:18:12.200
<i>...and you should know the name of the girl
who dozes off into the world of fiction.</i>

00:18:33.810 --> 00:18:34.520
Why?

00:18:34.680 --> 00:18:38.730
Marie-chan, you don't have to force yourself
all on your own anymore.

00:18:38.730 --> 00:18:41.020
Tell us what happened to you, okay?

00:18:41.440 --> 00:18:42.980
You just won't give it up.

00:18:45.700 --> 00:18:49.570
I made the decision myself! To die here!

00:18:49.570 --> 00:18:52.040
Nobody has the right to get in my way!

00:18:52.040 --> 00:18:54.250
Huh! Well, that's true.

00:18:54.250 --> 00:18:58.540
True, we don't have the right
to reject your decision.

00:18:58.830 --> 00:18:59.670
But!

00:18:59.670 --> 00:19:02.550
Even so, you absolutely can't die alone!

00:19:02.840 --> 00:19:04.550
But why not?

00:19:05.670 --> 00:19:07.300
Because you're our friend!

00:19:10.470 --> 00:19:14.220
Just stop, will you?
If your happiness is compromised,

00:19:14.220 --> 00:19:17.310
then I won't know what I'm dying for!

00:19:17.520 --> 00:19:20.810
Marie, what are you hiding?
Tell us everything!

00:19:21.230 --> 00:19:25.690
No! Because I know.
That you're all busybodies.

00:19:26.360 --> 00:19:30.370
That's why I stole your memories
and kept you at a distance!

00:19:30.780 --> 00:19:32.870
Why did you have to go that far?

00:19:34.240 --> 00:19:35.450
Go home!

00:19:36.410 --> 00:19:38.420
I'm begging you, just leave!

00:19:39.170 --> 00:19:43.130
You guys are the worst.
Seriously! Can't take a hint!

00:19:43.130 --> 00:19:45.960
If you're gonna be like this,
I wish we'd never met!

00:19:45.960 --> 00:19:47.260
Marie!

00:19:51.760 --> 00:19:54.220
I hate you all!

00:19:55.390 --> 00:19:57.100
Then eliminate them.

00:19:57.100 --> 00:19:58.270
Huh?

00:19:58.270 --> 00:20:02.480
Troublesome fools forcing the truth
you don't want to see on you...

00:20:02.480 --> 00:20:04.110
Fools like that can...

00:20:11.360 --> 00:20:12.490
I...

00:20:13.580 --> 00:20:14.620
Marie!

00:20:17.450 --> 00:20:18.870
What's going on?

00:20:18.870 --> 00:20:21.250
Don't tell me that's Marie-chan?

00:20:21.250 --> 00:20:23.250
N-No way...

00:20:23.840 --> 00:20:25.840
Hey, what's wrong, Teddie?

00:20:26.130 --> 00:20:29.130
I can hear all these people's voices.

00:20:29.130 --> 00:20:33.140
Voices saying that they don't want
to see the truth... That's...

00:20:33.760 --> 00:20:35.760
A mass of fog?

00:20:41.060 --> 00:20:43.770
She's there! Marie-chan is inside that thing!

00:20:44.060 --> 00:20:47.780
Then... that means if we smash this thing,
we can save her, right?

00:20:47.780 --> 00:20:49.570
We can't be 100% sure, but...

00:20:49.570 --> 00:20:51.570
We just gotta do it!

00:20:54.450 --> 00:20:55.490
Persona!

00:21:01.290 --> 00:21:02.790
I won't let you!

00:21:17.890 --> 00:21:19.560
What the...?

00:21:25.360 --> 00:21:27.320
Our Personas are...

00:21:35.950 --> 00:21:36.570
Run...

00:23:34.400 --> 00:23:36.740
Life is truth. It is never a dream,

00:23:36.740 --> 00:23:39.570
That which all souls
know from birth to be the truth

00:23:39.570 --> 00:23:43.410
Is to be chosen, is to be discovered
with one's gaze and will.

00:23:43.410 --> 00:23:46.410
Only by gaining that
does one become truth himself.

00:23:46.410 --> 00:23:49.750
One can become the thread
that connects past and future.

00:23:49.750 --> 00:23:52.380
But now the visitor's fate has been halted,

00:23:52.420 --> 00:23:55.800
And the truth is somewhere
inside this foggy Hollow Forest.

00:24:03.390 --> 00:24:06.730
I'm an enemy, you know. That means
there's no way we can be together.

00:24:06.730 --> 00:24:09.270
You're a terrible liar, Marie.

00:24:09.270 --> 00:24:11.400
What's wrong with turning away
from suffering?

00:24:11.400 --> 00:24:13.900
Shut up!
The voice I want to hear is Marie's!
